    {
      "id": "claim_7b117827bb624777b22edfd71de9f051",
      "statement": "Asynchronous processing separates request acceptance from background work through a queue, and its operational contract includes back pressure, exponential-backoff retries, delayed results, possible message loss, and non-guaranteed ordering in standard queues.",
