    {
      "id": "claim_9f20c6fd2fb84feba024f0a492285621",
      "statement": "S3-first durability persists a raw event payload to object storage before enqueueing processing work, so a worker or analytical-store failure can be recovered by replaying the retained payload; the API can therefore accept data before it appears in analytical tables.",
      "evidence": [
